## Why local SEO matters

When someone in Cardiff searches "web designer near me" or "plumber Merthyr Tydfil", Google shows local businesses first. Local SEO puts your business in those results — in front of people actively looking for what you offer, right now.

Without it, even a beautifully [designed website](/services/web-development/) will sit invisible on page three. With it, you become the obvious choice for local customers.

## What we do

We optimise your entire online presence for local search — from your website to your Google Business Profile to your presence in local directories. Every month we send a plain-English report showing your rankings, traffic, and leads.

## Areas we cover

We run local SEO campaigns for businesses across [Cardiff](/seo-cardiff/), [Swansea](/seo-swansea/), [Newport](/seo-newport/), [Merthyr Tydfil](/seo-merthyr-tydfil/), [Bridgend](/seo-bridgend/), [Port Talbot](/seo-port-talbot/), [Rhondda](/seo-rhondda/), [Vale of Glamorgan](/seo-vale-of-glamorgan/), and throughout [South Wales](/seo-south-wales/). Wherever your customers are searching, we'll make sure they find you.

## Link building

Backlinks — other websites linking to yours — are one of the strongest signals Google uses to determine how trustworthy and authoritative your site is. As part of our SEO campaigns, we build a steady stream of relevant, high-quality links to your site through local business directories, industry citations, and outreach to relevant websites.

We focus on links that actually move rankings, not bulk low-quality submissions that can do more harm than good. Every link we build is relevant to your business and your location, reinforcing your authority in local search results.

## Pairing SEO with a great website

SEO works best when your website is fast, well-structured, and built to convert. If you need a new site alongside your SEO campaign, our [web design service](/services/web-design/) includes on-page SEO foundations as standard. We can also pair your campaign with [managed hosting](/services/website-hosting-security/) and [monthly maintenance](/services/website-maintenance-packages/) for a complete online presence.

